            <p>You should land on a line like <code>projects: [</code>. Everything until the matching closing <code>]</code> is the projects list. The starter already has three sample projects (Campus Resource Finder, Home Lab Notes, Secure Setup Checklist) — replace those with your real work, or keep one and edit it.</p>
